					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-5728059#post-3768461</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-5728059/critter-profile:caddy#post-3768461</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 13 Apr 2018 21:45:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DarkStuff</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1581620</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Oh hey! It got posted! I hadn't noticed! Well, upvoted with extreme prejudice, because my bias is tangible, but it is worth noting that I <em>did</em> read it and like it. Caddy is not cute if you think about it. Bunch of fish stuck together in a serpentine shape through an adhesive. That kind of dissonance is what enhances the weirdness though. I like that they love Caddy and she is essentially an amorphous mass of sticky fish, so she's covered in random assortments of eyes and mouths and fins. Kinda gross.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
